@startuml
title Delete Product (by id or name) - sequence (as implemented)
actor User
participant UI as "MyInventorySystem"
participant Manager as "InventoryManager"

User -> UI: selects "Delete Product"
UI -> UI: prompt for id or name
alt input is numeric
  UI -> Manager: DeleteProduct(int id)
else input is text
  UI -> Manager: DeleteProduct(string name)
end
Manager --> UI: console output (found/not found)
UI -> User: display result
@enduml
